 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 532514,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the area of a rectangular region with a length of 18 feet and a width 1/3 of the length.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The area of a rectangle is <span data-math=\"A = LW\"></span>where <i>L</i> represents the length and <i>W</i> represents the width.</p>\n<p>The length is 18 feet.</p>\n<p>Break the width expression into its components.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>The width</td>\n<td>is</td>\n<td>one third of the length</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>width</td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\left( {18{\\text{ ft}}} \\right)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>width = <span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\left( {18{\\rm{\\ ft}}} \\right) = {\\rm{ 6\\ ft}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"A = LW = \\left( {18{\\rm{\\ ft}}} \\right)\\left( {{\\rm{6\\ ft}}} \\right) = 108{\\rm{\\ f}}{{\\rm{t}}^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>The area is 108 square feet.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "108 ft<sup>2</sup>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
